{"id":"f0ea0e26dd8bcf09","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-divrem-function.md","title":"Division and Remainder Functions (Primitive Recursive)","display":"df-divrem-function — Division and Remainder Functions (Primitive Recursive)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-divrem-function","aliases":["90-df-divrem-function","90-df-div-rem"],"display":"df-divrem-function — Division and Remainder Functions (Primitive Recursive)","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]","[[90-df-iota-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-divrem-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-divrem-function</span><span>90-df-div-rem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-divrem-function — Division and Remainder Functions (Primitive Recursive)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d54f327008e148ac\" href=\"?note=d54f327008e148ac\" title=\"90-df-iota-operator\">90-df-iota-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-divrem-function-—-Division-and-Remainder-Functions\">df-divrem-function — Division and Remainder Functions</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；加法、乘法及次序采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a> 的自然数语境。</li>\n<li>唯一描述采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d54f327008e148ac\" href=\"?note=d54f327008e148ac\" title=\"90-df-iota-operator\">90-df-iota-operator</a> 的公式／变量模式。对子序对的记法先以单个变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 绑定有序对，不使用未定义的多变量描述算子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nE(x,y,z)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists q,r\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(z=\\langle q,r\\rangle\\land x=yq+r\\land r&lt;y),\\\\\ny&gt;0&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\exists!z\\,E(x,y,z),\\\\\nd(x,y)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\iota z\\,E(x,y,z),&amp;y&gt;0,\\\\\\langle0,x\\rangle,&amp;y=0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\langle\\operatorname{div}(x,y),\\operatorname{rem}(x,y)\\rangle&amp;:=d(x,y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nE(x,y,z)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists q,r\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(z=\\langle q,r\\rangle\\land x=yq+r\\land r&lt;y),\\\\\ny&gt;0&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\exists!z\\,E(x,y,z),\\\\\nd(x,y)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\iota z\\,E(x,y,z),&amp;y&gt;0,\\\\\\langle0,x\\rangle,&amp;y=0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\langle\\operatorname{div}(x,y),\\operatorname{rem}(x,y)\\rangle&amp;:=d(x,y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 归纳可得正除数的商余数存在；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"yq+r=yq&#39;+r&#39;\">\\(yq+r=yq&#39;+r&#39;\\)</span> 且两个余数均小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，比较 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,q&#39;\">\\(q,q&#39;\\)</span> 即得二者相等。故最后一行通过有序对投影唯一引入两个全函数。保留除数为零时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{div}(x,0),\\operatorname{rem}(x,0))=(0,x)\">\\((\\operatorname{div}(x,0),\\operatorname{rem}(x,0))=(0,x)\\)</span> 的原约定；不把这一定义改成部分除法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-divrem-function-—-Division-and-Remainder-Functions","text":"df-divrem-function — Division and Remainder Functions","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-iota-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d54f327008e148ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-iota-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathbb N$；加法、乘法及次序采用 [[90-df-omega]] 的自然数语境。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-iota-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d54f327008e148ac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"唯一描述采用 [[90-df-iota-operator]] 的公式／变量模式。对子序对的记法先以单个变量 $z$ 绑定有序对，不使用未定义的多变量描述算子。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nE(x,y,z)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists q,r\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(z=\\langle q,r\\rangle\\land x=yq+r\\land r<y),\\\\\ny>0&\\Longrightarrow\\exists!z\\,E(x,y,z),\\\\\nd(x,y)&:=\\begin{cases}\\iota z\\,E(x,y,z),&y>0,\\\\\\langle0,x\\rangle,&y=0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\langle\\operatorname{div}(x,y),\\operatorname{rem}(x,y)\\rangle&:=d(x,y).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"yq+r=yq'+r'","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"q,q'","display":false},{"tex":"(\\operatorname{div}(x,0),\\operatorname{rem}(x,0))=(0,x)","display":false}],"bytes":1361,"backlinks":[{"id":"1cdf7925a164f89d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-divrem-function]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addi